    {
        "Id": 43,
        "ActionId": 43,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Say, we were hoping you'd be able to share some actual solutions with us, sir.",
            44
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 44,
        "ActionId": 44,
        "Type": 301,
        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "EndAnim": "DialogDisable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Councilor from Babylonia",
            "...Since we have the Gray Raven Commandant here with us, perhaps we could arrange for a... smaller accident? What do you say?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 45,
        "ActionId": 45,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Out of the question. I have never and will never make such compromises.",
            46
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 46,
        "ActionId": 46,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "If I take one step back, you will make me compromise again.",
            47
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 47,
        "ActionId": 47,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "I don't care how you slice the cake, but everyone who remains has to stay alive.",
            48
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 48,
        "ActionId": 48,
        "Type": 301,
        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Councilor from Babylonia",
            "Hah... If you two think you can get something for nothing, then we have nothing left to discuss.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 49,
        "ActionId": 49,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Councilor from Babylonia",
            "That being said... Babylonia isn't the only party behind this operation, is it? Shouldn't you consider Norman Mining Corp's opinion before making such decisions?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 50,
        "ActionId": 50,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "????",
            "Whatever Gray Raven Commandant decides to do, that would be our decision, too."
        ]
    },
